# 🧠 Dynamic Personality Calculator

A fun and interactive **Dynamic Personality Calculator** built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**. The website asks users a series of personality-based questions and dynamically analyzes their answers to determine which personality type best matches them.

## ✨ Features

* 🧠 Interactive personality quiz
* 🎯 Dynamic personality calculation
* 📊 Progress bar showing quiz progress
* 💜 Modern gradient-based UI
* 🏆 Multiple personality types
* 📋 Personalized personality description
* 💯 Personality score calculation
* 🏷️ Personality traits display
* 🔄 Restart quiz functionality
* 📱 Responsive design for mobile and desktop
* ⚡ Smooth hover and interactive effects



## 🛠️ Technologies Used

* **HTML5** – Structure of the application
* **CSS3** – Styling, responsive layout and animations
* **JavaScript** – Quiz logic, scoring system and DOM manipulation


## 🎯 Purpose

This project was created to practice **JavaScript logic, DOM manipulation, event handling, conditional statements, dynamic content generation, and responsive frontend design** while building an engaging real-world web application.

